--- A0. the discovery feed: Coming Soon with no on-sale date or one still ahead is an upcoming sale; with a date already passed the label is stale
 n |   status    | onsale | upcoming_sale 
---+-------------+--------+---------------
 1 | Coming Soon | none   | t
 2 | Coming Soon | ahead  | t
 3 | Coming Soon | passed | f
 4 | Buy Tickets | passed | f
 5 | Buy Presale | ahead  | f
 6 | Sold Out    | none   | f
 7 | -           | ahead  | t
 8 | -           | none   | f

--- A. what a read says: the answer itself; "no tickets available" only under a Coming Soon label
 n |    outcome     |                       error                        |   status    | not_on_sale 
---+----------------+----------------------------------------------------+-------------+-------------
 1 | unparsed       | Tickets for this event are not currently on sale.  | Coming Soon | t
 2 | unparsed       | Tickets for this event are not on sale yet.        | Buy Tickets | t
 3 | unparsed       | No tickets are currently available for this event. | Coming Soon | t
 4 | unparsed       | No tickets are currently available for this event. | Buy Tickets | f
 5 | ok             | -                                                  | Coming Soon | f
 6 | empty          | -                                                  | Coming Soon | f
 7 | upstream_error | HTTP 429 from TicketsData                          | Coming Soon | f
 8 | -              | -                                                  | -           | f

